<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Your Average Froyoyoyo Sim</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- Google Fonts for Hand-Drawn & Retro Aesthetics -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@400;600;700&family=Press+Start+2P&family=Sniglet:wght@400;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Tone.js for cozy sound effects -->
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/tone/14.8.49/Tone.js"></script>
    
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Sniglet', 'Fredoka', cursive, sans-serif;
            user-select: none;
            -webkit-user-select: none;
            touch-action: manipulation;
            transition: background-color 0.4s ease, color 0.4s ease;
        }

        .font-display {
            font-family: 'Fredoka', cursive, sans-serif;
        }

        .font-retro {
            font-family: 'Press Start 2P', monospace;
        }

        /* Level 1: Hand-drawn Doodle Theme */
        .theme-tutorial {
            background-color: #FFFBEB;
            color: #1E293B;
        }

        .theme-tutorial .doodle-border {
            border: 4px solid #332722;
            border-radius: 255px 15px 225px 15px/15px 225px 15px 255px;
            box-shadow: 4px 5px 0px #332722;
            background-color: #FFFFFF;
        }

        .theme-tutorial .doodle-button {
            border: 3px solid #332722;
            border-radius: 20px 8px 18px 10px/10px 18px 8px 20px;
            box-shadow: 3px 4px 0px #332722;
            transition: all 0.15s ease-in-out;
        }

        .theme-tutorial .doodle-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.02);
            box-shadow: 4px 6px 0px #332722;
        }

        .theme-tutorial .doodle-button:active {
            transform: translateY(2px);
            box-shadow: 1px 2px 0px #332722;
        }

        /* Level 2: Retro Shop Theme */
        .theme-retro {
            background-color: #1A1A2E;
            color: #F8FAF2;
        }

        .theme-retro .doodle-border {
            border: 4px solid #FF007F;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0px 0px 15px rgba(255, 0, 127, 0.4), 4px 5px 0px #00F0FF;
            background-color: #16213E !important;
        }

        .theme-retro .doodle-button {
            border: 3px solid #00F0FF;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 3px 4px 0px #FF007F;
            transition: all 0.15s ease-in-out;
        }

        .theme-retro .doodle-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.02);
            box-shadow: 0px 0px 10px #00F0FF, 4px 6px 0px #FF007F;
        }

        .theme-retro .doodle-button:active {
            transform: translateY(2px);
            box-shadow: 1px 2px 0px #FF007F;
        }

        /* Level 3: Cozy Dog Cafe Theme */
        .theme-cozy {
            background-color: #FEF3C7;
            color: #1F2937;
        }

        .theme-cozy .doodle-border {
            border: 4px solid #065F46;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 4px 5px 0px #065F46;
            background-color: #ECFDF5 !important;
        }

        .theme-cozy .doodle-button {
            border: 3px solid #065F46;
            border-radius: 14px;
            box-shadow: 3px 4px 0px #065F46;
            transition: all 0.15s ease-in-out;
        }

        .theme-cozy .doodle-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.02);
            box-shadow: 4px 6px 0px #065F46;
        }

        .theme-cozy .doodle-button:active {
            transform: translateY(2px);
            box-shadow: 1px 2px 0px #065F46;
        }

        /* Level 4: Space Moon Theme */
        .theme-moon {
            background-color: #0F172A;
            color: #F8FAFC;
        }

        .theme-moon .doodle-border {
            border: 4px solid #A855F7;
            border-radius: 18px;
            box-shadow: 0px 0px 15px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.4), 4px 5px 0px #3B82F6;
            background-color: #1E293B !important;
        }

        .theme-moon .doodle-button {
            border: 3px solid #3B82F6;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 3px 4px 0px #A855F7;
            transition: all 0.15s ease-in-out;
        }

        .theme-moon .doodle-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.02);
            box-shadow: 0px 0px 10px #3B82F6, 4px 6px 0px #A855F7;
        }

        .theme-moon .doodle-button:active {
            transform: translateY(2px);
            box-shadow: 1px 2px 0px #A855F7;
        }

        /* SVG wiggle effect */
        @keyframes wiggle {
            0%, 100% { transform: rotate(-1deg); }
            50% { transform: rotate(1deg); }
        }

        .doodle-wiggle {
            animation: wiggle 3s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        /* Lever Pulsing Animation */
        @keyframes leverPulse {
            0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }
            50% { transform: scale(1.05); }
        }

        .lever-active {
            animation: leverPulse 0.6s infinite;
        }

        /* Custom Scrollbar */
        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 8px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: #FFF3E0;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: #FFB74D;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body id="app-body" class="theme-tutorial min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-pink-200">

    <!-- Header / Navbar -->
    <header id="app-header" class="w-full bg-orange-200 border-b-4 border-amber-900/80 px-4 py-3 shadow-md flex justify-between items-center z-10 transition-colors duration-300">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
            <span class="text-3xl">🍦</span>
            <div>
                <h1 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold font-display text-amber-950 tracking-wide" id="main-title">Your Average Froyoyoyo Sim</h1>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-amber-800" id="level-subtitle">Select a Level to Start</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <button onclick="showLevelSelectModal()" class="doodle-button bg-pink-300 hover:bg-pink-200 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-bold text-amber-950 flex items-center gap-1">
                🗺️ <span class="hidden sm:inline">Levels</span>
            </button>
            <button id="btn-sound" onclick="toggleSound()" class="doodle-button bg-yellow-300 hover:bg-yellow-200 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-bold text-amber-950 flex items-center gap-1">
                <span id="sound-icon">🔊</span> <span class="hidden sm:inline">Audio</span>
            </button>
            <button onclick="showInstructions()" class="doodle-button bg-sky-300 hover:bg-sky-200 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-bold text-amber-950">
                ❓ How to Play
            </button>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- MAIN APP CONTAINER -->
    <main class="flex-grow container mx-auto px-2 sm:px-4 py-4 max-w-4xl flex flex-col justify-center items-center">
        
        <!-- START / MAIN MENU SCREEN -->
        <section id="view-menu" class="w-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center py-6 px-4">
            <div class="bg-white/90 p-6 sm:p-10 doodle-border max-w-lg w-full relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="text-6xl mb-3 doodle-wiggle inline-block">🍦✨</div>
                <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold font-display text-amber-900 mb-2" id="menu-heading">Froyo Shop Hub</h2>
                <p class="text-base text-amber-800 mb-6 font-semibold" id="menu-desc">Choose your level and start making delicious frozen yogurt orders!</p>

                <!-- Level Selector Cards -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 mb-6">
                    <!-- Level 1 Card -->
                    <button onclick="selectLevelAndStart(0)" class="doodle-button bg-amber-100 hover:bg-amber-200 p-4 rounded-xl text-left border-2 border-amber-900 flex items-center gap-4 transition">
                        <span class="text-4xl">✏️</span>
                        <div>
                            <div class="font-extrabold text-amber-950 text-lg">Level 1: Tutorial</div>
                            <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-800">Learn the basics with 2 practice customers</div>
                        </div>
                    </button>

                    <!-- Level 2 Card -->
                    <button id="btn-level-2" onclick="selectLevelAndStart(1)" class="doodle-button bg-fuchsia-100 hover:bg-fuchsia-200 p-4 rounded-xl text-left border-2 border-fuchsia-900 flex items-center gap-4 transition">
                        <span class="text-4xl">🕹️</span>
                        <div>
                            <div class="font-extrabold text-fuchsia-950 text-lg flex items-center gap-2">
                                <span>Day 1: The Average Retro Shop</span>
                                <span id="badge-lvl2" class="text-xs bg-emerald-300 text-emerald-950 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-emerald-800">Unlocked</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-fuchsia-800">3 retro customers • Small & Large cups • Chocolate flavor • Strawberries & Blackberries</div>
                        </div>
                    </button>

                    <!-- Level 3 Card -->
                    <button id="btn-level-3" onclick="selectLevelAndStart(2)" class="doodle-button bg-emerald-100 hover:bg-emerald-200 p-4 rounded-xl text-left border-2 border-emerald-900 flex items-center gap-4 transition">
                        <span class="text-4xl">🐶</span>
                        <div>
                            <div class="font-extrabold text-emerald-950 text-lg flex items-center gap-2">
                                <span>Day 2: Dogs & Double Flavors</span>
                                <span id="badge-lvl3" class="text-xs bg-emerald-300 text-emerald-950 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-emerald-800">Unlocked</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-800">5 customers (3 Humans, 2 Dogs) • Strawberry-and-Cream unlocked!</div>
                        </div>
                    </button>

                    <!-- Level 4 Card -->
                    <button id="btn-level-4" onclick="selectLevelAndStart(3)" class="doodle-button bg-indigo-100 hover:bg-indigo-200 p-4 rounded-xl text-left border-2 border-indigo-900 flex items-center gap-4 transition">
                        <span class="text-4xl">🚀</span>
                        <div>
                            <div class="font-extrabold text-indigo-950 text-lg flex items-center gap-2">
                                <span>Day 3: Moon Mission</span>
                                <span id="badge-lvl4" class="text-xs bg-emerald-300 text-emerald-950 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-emerald-800">Unlocked</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-indigo-800">8 space customers (1 Human, 3 Dogs, 4 French Aliens) • Mooncheese flavor & space toppings!</div>
                        </div>
                    </button>
                </div>

                <div class="text-xs text-amber-700 font-bold bg-amber-100/80 p-3 rounded-lg border border-amber-800">
                    💡 Tip: Aim for at least 80% accuracy score on each stage to pass!
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- GAMEPLAY SCREEN -->
        <section id="view-game" class="hidden w-full flex flex-col gap-4 items-center">
            
            <!-- Customer Order Banner -->
            <div id="order-banner" class="w-full bg-white doodle-border p-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4">
                <!-- Customer Character Avatar -->
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col items-center">
                    <div id="customer-avatar" class="w-20 h-20 sm:w-24 sm:h-24 rounded-full bg-amber-200 border-4 border-amber-900 flex items-center justify-center text-4xl shadow-inner">
                        🧑‍🦱
                    </div>
                    <span id="customer-name" class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-900 mt-1 bg-amber-200 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-amber-800">Customer 1</span>
                </div>

                <!-- Speech Bubble -->
                <div class="relative flex-grow bg-amber-100 p-4 rounded-2xl border-2 border-amber-900 text-amber-950 w-full" id="speech-bubble">
                    <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-700 font-bold mb-1" id="order-label">Customer Order:</p>
                    <p id="customer-dialogue" class="text-base sm:text-lg font-extrabold text-amber-900">
                        "Hi! Can I please have a plain Vanilla froyo?"
                    </p>
                    <div id="order-recipe-tag" class="mt-2 inline-block bg-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-800 text-amber-800">
                        Recipe Target: Basic Cup + Vanilla Froyo (Plain)
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Froyo Workbench & Interactive Canvas -->
            <div class="w-full grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-4 items-start">
                
                <!-- Left Control Panel: Cups & Flavors -->
                <div class="md:col-span-4 bg-white doodle-border p-4 flex flex-col gap-4" id="left-panel">
                    <!-- Step 1: Choose Cup -->
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg border-b-2 border-amber-800 pb-1 flex items-center justify-between" id="header-step1">
                        <span>1. Choose Cup</span>
                        <span id="step1-check" class="text-sm">⭕</span>
                    </h3>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-1 gap-2" id="cup-selector-container">
                        <!-- Populated dynamically based on level -->
                    </div>

                    <!-- Step 2: Dispense Flavor -->
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg border-b-2 border-amber-800 pb-1 mt-2 flex items-center justify-between" id="header-step2">
                        <span>2. Dispense Flavor</span>
                        <span id="step2-check" class="text-sm">⭕</span>
                    </h3>
                    <div class="flex flex-col gap-2" id="flavor-selector-container">
                        <!-- Populated dynamically based on level -->
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Center Interactive Canvas Workbench -->
                <div id="canvas-container" class="md:col-span-5 bg-orange-100/60 doodle-border p-4 flex flex-col items-center justify-center relative min-h-[340px]">
                    <div id="counter-badge" class="absolute top-2 left-2 text-xs font-bold bg-white/80 px-2 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-800 text-amber-900">
                        Prep Counter
                    </div>

                    <!-- Main Drawing Canvas for Froyo -->
                    <canvas id="froyoCanvas" width="300" height="280" class="cursor-pointer max-w-full h-auto"></canvas>

                    <div id="canvas-hint" class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-800 bg-amber-200/80 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-700 mt-2 text-center">
                        Select a cup to begin!
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Right Control Panel: Toppings & Serve -->
                <div class="md:col-span-3 bg-white doodle-border p-4 flex flex-col gap-4 justify-between h-full" id="right-panel">
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg border-b-2 border-amber-800 pb-1 flex items-center justify-between" id="header-step3">
                            <span>3. Toppings</span>
                            <span id="step3-check" class="text-sm">⭕</span>
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-amber-700 font-semibold mb-2" id="toppings-subtext">Click to add requested toppings!</p>
                        
                        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2" id="toppings-selector-container">
                            <!-- Populated dynamically based on level -->
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="pt-4 border-t-2 border-amber-200 mt-4">
                        <button onclick="clearCup()" class="w-full text-xs text-rose-700 hover:text-rose-900 font-bold mb-3 underline text-center block">
                            🗑️ Start Over Cup
                        </button>

                        <button id="btn-serve" onclick="serveOrder()" class="doodle-button w-full bg-emerald-400 hover:bg-emerald-300 text-amber-950 font-extrabold text-lg py-3 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-lg">
                            <span>🛎️ SERVE ORDER</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- RATING & EVALUATION MODAL -->
        <section id="view-rating" class="hidden fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-sm z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4">
            <div id="rating-card" class="bg-amber-50 doodle-border p-6 max-w-md w-full text-center relative">
                <div class="text-5xl mb-2" id="rating-emoji">⭐⭐⭐</div>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-amber-950 mb-1" id="rating-title">Order Served!</h3>
                <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-amber-800 mb-4" id="rating-subtitle">Here is how you did on this order:</p>

                <!-- Detailed Breakdown (40 pts system) -->
                <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border-2 border-amber-900 text-left space-y-2 mb-4 text-sm font-bold text-amber-900" id="rating-breakdown">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b pb-1">
                        <span>🎯 Accuracy (Cup, Flavor, Toppings):</span>
                        <span id="score-accuracy" class="text-emerald-700">20 / 20</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b pb-1">
                        <span>⚡ Speed (Smooth fulfillment):</span>
                        <span id="score-speed" class="text-emerald-700">10 / 10</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b pb-1">
                        <span>🎨 Precision (Amount & Neatness):</span>
                        <span id="score-precision" class="text-emerald-700">10 / 10</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-base pt-1 font-extrabold border-t border-amber-900 text-amber-950">
                        <span>TOTAL SCORE:</span>
                        <span id="score-total" class="text-xl text-amber-900">40 / 40 pts</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div id="rating-feedback" class="bg-orange-100 p-3 rounded-lg border border-amber-800 text-xs font-semibold text-amber-950 mb-6 italic">
                    "Delicious! Perfect vanilla froyo!"
                </div>

                <button onclick="nextCustomer()" class="doodle-button bg-amber-400 hover:bg-amber-300 text-amber-950 font-bold text-lg px-6 py-3 w-full">
                    ➡️ Next Customer
                </button>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- LEVEL END SUMMARY MODAL -->
        <section id="view-summary" class="hidden fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/70 backdrop-blur-sm z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4">
            <!-- Win Screen -->
            <div id="summary-win" class="bg-amber-50 doodle-border p-6 sm:p-8 max-w-lg w-full text-center hidden">
                <div class="text-6xl mb-2">🎉🏆🎉</div>
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold font-display text-amber-950 mb-1" id="win-title">Level Passed!</h2>
                <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-amber-800 mb-4" id="win-subtitle">You served all customers with high scores!</p>

                <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border-2 border-amber-900 mb-6">
                    <div class="text-xs uppercase text-amber-700 font-bold">Overall Accuracy Rating</div>
                    <div class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-emerald-600 my-1" id="win-accuracy-percentage">100%</div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-amber-800 font-semibold" id="win-score-text">You earned total points!</p>
                </div>

                <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
                    <button id="btn-next-level" onclick="goToNextLevel()" class="doodle-button bg-emerald-400 hover:bg-emerald-300 text-amber-950 font-extrabold py-3 text-lg">
                        🚀 Continue to Next Level
                    </button>
                    <button onclick="restartLevel()" class="doodle-button bg-amber-300 hover:bg-amber-200 text-amber-950 font-bold py-2 text-sm">
                        🔄 Replay Level
                    </button>
                    <button onclick="returnToMenu()" class="doodle-button bg-sky-200 hover:bg-sky-100 text-amber-950 font-bold py-2 text-sm">
                        🏠 Main Menu
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Try Again Screen (Dog screen per prompt spec) -->
            <div id="summary-retry" class="bg-orange-50 doodle-border p-6 sm:p-8 max-w-lg w-full text-center hidden">
                <div class="text-7xl mb-2">🐶</div>
                <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold font-display text-amber-950 mb-1">Try again! It's okay!</h2>
                <p class="text-base font-semibold text-amber-800 mb-4">The friendly shop dog believes in you! Let's give it another shot.</p>

                <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border-2 border-amber-900 mb-6">
                    <div class="text-xs uppercase text-amber-700 font-bold">Overall Accuracy Rating</div>
                    <div class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-rose-500 my-1" id="retry-accuracy-percentage">60%</div>
                    <p class="text-xs text-amber-800 font-semibold">Goal: Need 80% or higher to pass!</p>
                </div>

                <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
                    <button onclick="restartLevel()" class="doodle-button bg-emerald-400 hover:bg-emerald-300 text-amber-950 font-bold text-lg py-3 px-8 w-full">
                        🐶 Try Again!
                    </button>
                    <button onclick="returnToMenu()" class="doodle-button bg-amber-200 hover:bg-amber-100 text-amber-950 font-bold py-2 text-sm">
                        🏠 Return to Main Menu
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- LEVEL SELECTOR MODAL -->
        <div id="modal-level-select" class="hidden fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/60 z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4">
            <div class="bg-amber-50 doodle-border p-6 max-w-md w-full relative">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-amber-950 mb-4 text-center">🗺️ Select Level</h3>
                <div class="space-y-3 mb-6">
                    <button onclick="selectLevelAndStart(0); hideLevelSelectModal();" class="doodle-button w-full bg-amber-200 hover:bg-amber-100 text-amber-950 p-3 font-bold text-left flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span>Level 1: Tutorial (The Basics)</span>
                        <span>✏️</span>
                    </button>
                    <button onclick="selectLevelAndStart(1); hideLevelSelectModal();" class="doodle-button w-full bg-fuchsia-200 hover:bg-fuchsia-100 text-fuchsia-950 p-3 font-bold text-left flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span>Level 2: Day 1 (Retro Shop)</span>
                        <span>🕹️</span>
                    </button>
                    <button onclick="selectLevelAndStart(2); hideLevelSelectModal();" class="doodle-button w-full bg-emerald-200 hover:bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-950 p-3 font-bold text-left flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span>Level 3: Day 2 (Dogs & Double Flavors)</span>
                        <span>🐶</span>
                    </button>
                    <button onclick="selectLevelAndStart(3); hideLevelSelectModal();" class="doodle-button w-full bg-indigo-200 hover:bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-950 p-3 font-bold text-left flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span>Level 4: Day 3 (Moon Mission)</span>
                        <span>🚀</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
                <button onclick="hideLevelSelectModal()" class="doodle-button bg-slate-300 text-slate-800 font-bold py-2 w-full text-sm">
                    Close
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- HOW TO PLAY MODAL -->
        <div id="modal-instructions" class="hidden fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/60 z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4">
            <div class="bg-amber-50 doodle-border p-6 max-w-md w-full relative">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-amber-950 mb-3 text-center">🍦 How to Play</h3>
                <div class="space-y-3 text-sm text-amber-900 font-semibold">
                    <p>1. <strong>Read the Order:</strong> Check the customer's request in their speech bubble (cup size, flavor, toppings).</p>
